{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他刚才只是歇了口气，原先那道难题又摆到眼前，他还是拿不定主意。\",\n      \"key\": \"难题又摆到眼前\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道自己有些胆怯，怕往前又把自己逼得太狠，也舍不得那种不必防备的生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"不必防备的生活\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R43\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S09-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留安静退去后迟疑重现，删去走了很远又回到原处的循环比喻。短暂歇息没有解开原先的难题，既解释了为何再次拿不定主意，也不抹平经历之后的变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R44\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S09-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"找回并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他开始辨认迟疑中既有胆怯，也有不愿失去的生活希望。沿用上一轮对往前会把自己逼得太狠的担心，同时补回胆怯这一真实感受，不把两者写成工整对照，也不替他宣布已经找到答案。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9797243d-9681-4903-89e7-08cdefc299fa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T171428773249Z", "elapsed_seconds": 540.813, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:23:29.591910+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified"